### 1a. Process Direct Text Message
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/process-text
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "I am extremely unhappy and I want to cancel my account immediately."
}

### 1b. Process Direct Text Message (Agent Response)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/process-text
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "I completely understand your concern and I am happy to help resolve this for you right away.",
  "speaker": "agent"
}

### 1c. Process Message with Previous Score
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/process-text
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "I am extremely angry and furious about this issue!",
  "speaker": "caller",
  "previous_score": -60.0
}

### 1d. Process Message with Custom Negative Thresholds
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/process-text
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "I am extremely angry and furious about this issue!",
  "speaker": "caller",
  "previous_score": -60.0,
  "negative_threshold_1": 40.0,
  "negative_threshold_1_dampening_factor": 0.4,
  "negative_threshold_2": 75.0,
  "negative_threshold_2_dampening_factor": 0.15
}

### 2. Extract & Detect Admin Keywords
POST http://localhost:8002/extract-keywords
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "I want to cancel my account because of terrible service."
}

### 3a. Analyze Single Sentence Sentiment
POST http://localhost:8003/analyze-sentiment
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "Thank you so much for your quick and wonderful support!"
}

### 3b. Analyze Batch Sentences Sentiment
POST http://localhost:8003/analyze-sentiment-batch
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [
    {
      "isolated_sentence": "This service is terrible and completely unacceptable."
    },
    {
      "isolated_sentence": "I appreciate your help in resolving my billing problem."
    },
    {
      "isolated_sentence": "My customer ID number is 98765."
    }
  ]
}

### 4a. Calculate Score (Standard Defaults)
POST http://localhost:8004/calculate-score
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "emotion": "anger",
  "confidence": 0.80,
  "previous_score": -55.0
}

### 4b. Calculate Score (Custom Negative Thresholds)
POST http://localhost:8004/calculate-score
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "emotion": "anger",
  "confidence": 0.80,
  "previous_score": -55.0,
  "negative_threshold_1": 40.0,
  "negative_threshold_1_dampening_factor": 0.4,
  "negative_threshold_2": 75.0,
  "negative_threshold_2_dampening_factor": 0.15
}

### 4c. Calculate Score (Positive Dampening Threshold at 80.0)
POST http://localhost:8004/calculate-score
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "emotion": "gratitude",
  "confidence": 0.95,
  "previous_score": 85.0
}
